{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"日当たりのいい部屋がいいにゃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！87回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nあいさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"SUUMO(スーモ)さんの\n私たちが出演しているCM動画\n明日まで公開ですー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://m.youtube.com/watch?feature=youtu.be&v=AT2ILrmwXkg"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとずつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目線が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違うよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日もいいましたが！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生  3歳のお誕生日おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年、一年"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろなことを経験させて頂けて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何が好きで何が不得意なのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろな事や景色を見て\n感じて思ったこともたくさんありました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番楽しかったのも\n一番嬉しかったのも\n一番幸せだったのも\n一番希望を持ったのも\n去年。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番辛かったのも\n一番泣いたのも\n一番苦しかったのも\n一番あきらめたのも\n去年。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、私はこの全部のことを\n明日からの毎日で越えたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近よく言われるのが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと1年、あと2年早かったら、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言われれば私だってそう思うよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今よりももっと違う未来だったのかなって思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今の私があるのは\n一年前の私も\n二年前の私も\n三年前の私も\n乃木坂46にはいって\nたくさんいろいろなことを思って感じて\n泣いて笑って\nあきらめなかったからだと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46に入ってまる三年。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年の、同じ学校に通っていた\n同級生は、学生生活の中での\n青春があって、\n楽しかった思い出がたくさんあると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、\n同級生のみんなの楽しかった思い出に\nきっと私はいないと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、自分でそれを選びました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳に向けて、成人式に向けて\n振袖を選んでる時、\n久しぶりに会うかもしれない同級生の\nみんなの思い出話にはきっと\n入れなくて、その話の中に私はいなくて\n悲しくなるかもしれないって思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、私は乃木坂46に\n青春の全てと思い出をかけました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46に入ってからまる3年。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいった時の年齢の16歳のままで\n気持ちは止まってます！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46にいる今が楽しくて幸せで\nたくさんの思い出もあって\nこれからもたくさんの思い出ができて\n私は乃木坂46で青春を駆け抜けます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここにいると、ずーっと\n青春時代を過ごせるような気持ちです！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生全体としては、\n去年13枚目シングル期間で、\n今までよりもずっと\nみんなとの全体の距離が\n縮まったと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつの時も\n未央奈が先頭でみんなを引っ張ってくれてると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も先陣切って堂々と二期生だけじゃなくて\n乃木坂46を引っ張っていけるような\n大きな存在になります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脅かす存在になります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このままじゃいられない！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このままでもいたくない！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"環境の変化や\nいろいろなことが変わるのが怖い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、変化しないことが一番怖い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰かの思いを動かせる\n誰かの思いを熱くできる\n人になりたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一年前！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幼い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  くくさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎こんばんわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎こんばんは！コメントありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんはの「は」を「わ」という派の方だ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も元、そうでした！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  あいさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんがファンをすごく大事にしてくれてるのが嬉しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎皆さんが、私を大切に思ってくれてるので\n私は皆さんの思いよりももっと\n皆さんを大事に大切に思ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  ブ～たんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎早いですね～、もう二期生も３周年かぁ～"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:FAAA6008831FD271AD1B1F08F2FA9B7E-06@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、頑張って成長して行ってね。\nずっと応援し続けますから。"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:FAAA6008831FD271AD1B1F08F2FA9B7E-07@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に、日々可愛くて綺麗になってますね、お日奈様"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:FAAA6008831FD271AD1B1F08F2FA9B7E-08@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなお日奈様に、どんどんハマって気になって仕方がないです、年甲斐もなくね（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎頑張りまくります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと、皆さんにハマれるようになるぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(329)  おひでさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎Zipperチェックしなきゃっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎チェックしてください！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、明日発売の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BUBKAさんも絶対チェックしてね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事なことだからもう一回！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日発売の   BUBKAさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソログラビアが掲載されています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"滴りグラビア！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どのくらい滴り日奈子なのかは\n皆さんみなさんがみてからの\nお楽しみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  みやじさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎冒頭のあいさつです\nらりんさんが卒業したので、これから私はきりんさんになります！\nどうも、北野日奈子です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎らりんさんが卒業されても\nらりんさんの代わりは私にはできません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんはらりんさんで\n私は私だから！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、らりんさんから学んだことは\n自分の力でいかしていけるように頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはこれにておわり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/29/6352368/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n78回目は13日の牛くんさんからです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんちゃんちゃん きいちゃんちゃん( •ㅈ• )"}],"source":"archive"}